# uniqtop

**A live system monitor for Linux terminals.**

## The dashboard

![uniqtop overview](img/image.png)

![CPU details](img/image1.png)

![Process monitor](img/image2.png)

## Run

```sh
make run
```

Press `1`–`3` to switch views, use the arrow or Page Up/Down keys to scroll, and press `q` or `Esc` to quit. NVIDIA GPU metrics require the NVIDIA driver and NVML.

